 "remarks": "Fabulous 3-level end unit at Spruce Meadows! A welcoming entry foyer with powder room leads to the eat-in kitchen and spacious sunlit living room featuring soaring ceilings, a cozy fireplace, sliders to deck and a separate dining area-perfect for entertaining. Upstairs offers the primary bedroom, a second bedroom with built-ins and an updated hall bath. The versatile finished lower level boasts new flooring, crown moldings, full bathroom and ample storage. Freshly painted interior and hardwood floors throughout complete this move-in ready home. Assigned parking space just steps from the unit adds everyday convenience. Conveniently located near Glenbrook Village shops and just minutes to vibrant downtown and the train station for an easy commute. Not to be missed!",
